      "text": "哎 没有100%挣钱的兄，我七月份亏一百多二百的时候你们也看见了不是吗？",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2vJb8Ncpins-3?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "103540063",
      "date": "26-10-08 21:18",
      "text": "我也没说割，打错字了，\n@股天乐\n，帮俺改一下。",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2vJb8Ncpins-3?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "103540049",
      "date": "26-10-08 21:17",
      "text": "钱难挣，屎也难吃！",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2vJb8Ncpins-3?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "103540014",
      "date": "26-10-08 21:16",
      "text": "救不了，我的操作都是公开区分享的，那地产跌停了，我也没说割，自己吓得地板赶紧割，然后地板又拉起来了，心态又受不住了，那东材我说了最多拿五天，今天是第五天，同样的票，同样的关注点，就有人挣钱有人赔钱，挣钱的不一定记你好，赔钱的肯定说你菜，交易还是自渡，谁也救不了谁。",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2vJb8Ncpins-3?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "103539944",
      "date": "26-10-08 21:12",
      "text": "抢完红包就取关，反手一个拉黑，穷疯了？",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2vJb8Ncpins-3?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "103539907",
      "date": "26-10-08 21:11",
      "text": "难搞就别搞，搞了就别嫌难，上礼拜该劝销户的都劝过了，没本事又懒的还想来A股挣钱，做梦。",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2vJb8Ncpins-4?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "103539876",
      "date": "26-10-08 21:10",
      "text": "多难搞？",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2vJb8Ncpins-4?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "103539872",
      "date": "26-10-08 21:09",
      "text": "现在不去强调中长期价值，你们受不了的，我自己做的短线节奏挺好的，也能挣到钱",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2vJb8Ncpins-4?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "103537739",
      "date": "26-10-08 19:42",
      "text": "也可以 聊聊天也挺好",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2vJb8Ncpins-5?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "103587986",
      "date": "26-10-10 15:32",
      "text": "写复盘吗？",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2vJb8Ncpins?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "103585817",
      "date": "26-10-10 12:34",
      "text": "看来我们天天刷的都是同一片视频",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2vJb8Ncpins?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "103585718",
      "date": "26-10-10 12:28",
      "text": "嗯宗门秘境开放 终于让你这个小散修进去了",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2vJb8Ncpins?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "103583132",
      "date": "26-10-10 09:36",
      "text": "大概率要开",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2vJb8Ncpins-2?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "103580489",
      "date": "26-10-09 23:16",
      "text": "你炫的这是啥呀",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2vJb8Ncpins-2?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "103580487",
      "date": "26-10-09 23:15",
      "text": "本来俺就没啥素质",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2vJb8Ncpins-2?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "103571457",
      "date": "26-10-09 16:47",
      "text": "兰州！忠诚！",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2vJb8Ncpins-3?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "103571451",
      "date": "26-10-09 16:47",
      "text": "找兄弟们帮你一下",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2vJb8Ncpins-3?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "103571060",
      "date": "26-10-09 16:36",
      "text": "晚上你们都去吃什么，让我参考一下",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2vJb8Ncpins-3?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "103570742",
      "date": "26-10-09 16:26",
      "text": "✔所以周一揭晓",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2vJb8Ncpins-3?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "103570521",
      "date": "26-10-09 16:20",
      "text": "",
      "images": [
        "https://css.tgb.cn/images/face/025.png"
      ],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2vJb8Ncpins-4?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "103570516",
      "date": "26-10-09 16:20",
      "text": "一边子去吧",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2vJb8Ncpins-4?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "103569806",
      "date": "26-10-09 16:02",
      "text": "节点是哪天",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2vJb8Ncpins-4?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "103569656",
      "date": "26-10-09 15:59",
      "text": "人生在世 吃喝二字",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2vJb8Ncpins-4?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "103569428",
      "date": "26-10-09 15:54",
      "text": "多想 告诉我",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2vJb8Ncpins-4?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "103569083",
      "date": "26-10-09 15:48",
      "text": "行",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2vJb8Ncpins-5?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "103569041",
      "date": "26-10-09 15:47",
      "text": "我喜欢你m",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2vJb8Ncpins-5?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "103568504",
      "date": "26-10-09 15:37",
      "text": "所以你们一撅屁股我就知道拉什么～",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2vJb8Ncpins-5?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "103568110",
      "date": "26-10-09 15:31",
      "text": "二两母",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2vJb8Ncpins-5?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "103568057",
      "date": "26-10-09 15:30",
      "text": "你想问你的长电？",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2vJb8Ncpins-5?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "103568043",
      "date": "26-10-09 15:30",
      "text": "那为啥今天才拉升啊",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2vJb8Ncpins-5?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "103567367",
      "date": "26-10-09 15:20",
      "text": "上什么班",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2vJb8Ncpins-6?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "103566357",
      "date": "26-10-09 15:07",
      "text": "真好，又要放假了",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2vJb8Ncpins-6?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "103565106",
      "date": "26-10-09 14:53",
      "text": "尾盘\n上午的\n电池\n，维持正常关注就好",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2vJb8Ncpins-6?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "103564632",
      "date": "26-10-09 14:45",
      "text": "你咋今天不上班啊",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2vJb8Ncpins-6?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "103564532",
      "date": "26-10-09 14:43",
      "text": "你看喜欢睡觉还是好事",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2vJb8Ncpins-7?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "103564522",
      "date": "26-10-09 14:43",
      "text": "三级跳",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2vJb8Ncpins-7?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "103564046",
      "date": "26-10-09 14:35",
      "text": "嗯这种极端情况是需要忍的 上午那姐们问的时候我也说了",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2vJb8Ncpins-7?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "103563471",
      "date": "26-10-09 14:25",
      "text": "没毛",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2vJb8Ncpins-8?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "103563271",
      "date": "26-10-09 14:21",
      "text": "网安我信不了一点 一丁点都信不来",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2vJb8Ncpins-8?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "103563253",
      "date": "26-10-09 14:21",
      "text": "好嘞收到",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2vJb8Ncpins-8?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "103563151",
      "date": "26-10-09 14:19",
      "text": "我真想捶死你",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2vJb8Ncpins-9?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "103562864",
      "date": "26-10-09 14:15",
      "text": "接上文\n然后下午共振的方向，一个是\n网络安全\n（或者说\n软件开发\n），另一个是泛消费（电影，\n零售\n这种），前者如果要走成主线，流氓软件（360）得给态度吧，但下午率先走强的是20cm的小票。\n后者消费，第一种理解是黄金的发散，第二种理解是老周期最后的套利。\n而现在的短剧，如果把它看作\n文化传媒\n的发散，就等于说一天之内这个方向发散完了。\n艹了个dj的，能不能看懂啊你们",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2vJb8Ncpins-9?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "103562050",
      "date": "26-10-09 14:03",
      "text": "我才反应过了，你丫不都销户了，你管他反着不反着呢，咸吃萝卜淡操心",
      "images": [
        "https://css.tgb.cn/images/face/021.png"
      ],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2vJb8Ncpins-9?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "103561901",
      "date": "26-10-09 14:00",
      "text": "回复你了，提前预判你的问题",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2vJb8Ncpins-9?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "103561883",
      "date": "26-10-09 13:59",
      "text": "下午指数回流，顺指数\n电池\n这里有回落，我的思考是：\n首先，上午10点40左右创业板有过一波拉升，对应的是电池板块的拉升，确实是顺指数。\n而下午指数拉起来，电池反而回落，这里其实和刚说的1000和500有关系，也就是说，当硅基生物识别到这里可能走不成大行情的时候，那小细分就按他本身的路径走了，而电池这里昨天日内回流偏小高潮，今天原本就是分歧预期，所以下午有些许回落",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2vJb8Ncpins-9?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "103560995",
      "date": "26-10-09 13:40",
      "text": "午后拉的是1000和500宽基，这一幕在7月科技大跌的时候出现过，而在24年924之前，他们拉的是300。\n那为什么拉1000和500？我觉得还是好拉，从目前他们的举动来看，这里不像是发动大行情的样子，后面还是看细分更多。",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2vJb8Ncpins-9?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "103560954",
      "date": "26-10-09 13:39",
      "text": "市场目前最弱的方向还是科技，但今天能看到明显下影线，这对于大势情绪企稳是有帮助的。\n不过真正好的上涨，不能只有“止跌企稳”，还得有一个能够主动站出来、形成明显引领的方向。\n节点附近，主动走强的，一个是内需消费，一个是券商。\n上午最强的\n电池\n，午后出现明显分流。\n只能判断指数，题材暂时无法判断。\n另外从宽基来看，今天放量比较明显的是中证500和\n中证1000\n，这个也可以继续作为观察市场风格切换的一个参考。",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2vJb8Ncpins-10?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "103558883",
      "date": "26-10-09 12:48",
      "text": "你这不行啊，点赞还没破万",
      "images": [
        "https://image.tgb.cn/img/2026/10/09/0jti0e0bl95f.jpg_760w.png"
      ],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2vJb8Ncpins-10?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "103558383",
      "date": "26-10-09 12:31",
      "text": "天际坑过我一次",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2vJb8Ncpins-10?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "103558021",
      "date": "26-10-09 12:21",
      "text": "大光我猜从高点跌50就会出现迹象了",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2vJb8Ncpins-10?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "103557997",
      "date": "26-10-09 12:20",
      "text": "一种图形模式",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2vJb8Ncpins-10?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "103557991",
      "date": "26-10-09 12:20",
      "text": "两发入定三发入魂",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2vJb8Ncpins-10?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "103555451",
      "date": "26-10-09 11:26",
      "text": "多等一下 临近收盘看看",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2vJb8Ncpins-11?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "103554667",
      "date": "26-10-09 11:13",
      "text": "两眼一闭全靠蒙",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2vJb8Ncpins-11?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "103554377",
      "date": "26-10-09 11:09",
      "text": "就是假设下周看涨的话，从指数角度，三大指数其实差不多趋同了，就是我早盘说的，上证这里要踩一下7月那个低点\n科技细分里上一轮主升的，这一轮主跌",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2vJb8Ncpins-12?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "103554315",
      "date": "26-10-09 11:08",
      "text": "没东西 全靠蒙",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2vJb8Ncpins-12?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "103554256",
      "date": "26-10-09 11:07",
      "text": "现在就看大光会不会让指数止跌了，如果可以止跌，不排除\n电池\n就是当时的\n元件\n。",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2vJb8Ncpins-12?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "103553783",
      "date": "26-10-09 10:59",
      "text": "刚才我在发创业板区间进入超卖的时候，价格领先情绪了已经，等价格起来了，情绪会去追价格，也就是说，大光止跌，情绪去追价格。你们还在压抑的时候，我已经疯狂了，一群辣鸡！",
      "images": [
        "https://image.tgb.cn/img/2026/10/09/gvpgdtd2nfvn.jpg_760w.png"
      ],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2vJb8Ncpins-12?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "103553227",
      "date": "26-10-09 10:52",
      "text": "评论完就取关是什么意思？找干",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2vJb8Ncpins-12?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "103553176",
      "date": "26-10-09 10:51",
      "text": "有啥压抑的啊擦 我咋感觉不到压抑啊",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2vJb8Ncpins-12?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "103553156",
      "date": "26-10-09 10:51",
      "text": "符合90%吧，在节前的时候",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2vJb8Ncpins-13?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "103552999",
      "date": "26-10-09 10:49",
      "text": "因为他前面是阴跌啊哥\n四月份开始调整的，到今天是不是正好半年？",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2vJb8Ncpins-13?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "103552766",
      "date": "26-10-09 10:46",
      "text": "事到如今唯一对不起的就是麻袋了",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2vJb8Ncpins-13?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "103552608",
      "date": "26-10-09 10:43",
      "text": "我对着盘面扫了一眼啊\n标准的形态应该是\n金龙羽\n，阳光乳液这种",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2vJb8Ncpins-13?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "103552402",
      "date": "26-10-09 10:41",
      "text": "没有黑子和我对喷我会很难过(ಥ﹏ಥ)",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2vJb8Ncpins-14?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "103552322",
      "date": "26-10-09 10:40",
      "text": "yes",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2vJb8Ncpins-14?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "103552294",
      "date": "26-10-09 10:40",
      "text": "我说你的复盘记录，筛选",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2vJb8Ncpins-14?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "103552099",
      "date": "26-10-09 10:37",
      "text": "有没有黑子啊，出来和我对喷一下",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2vJb8Ncpins-14?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "103552001",
      "date": "26-10-09 10:36",
      "text": "昨天你是问244的那个兄吗？那么多逆势的票你都没找到吗？",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2vJb8Ncpins-15?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "103551875",
      "date": "26-10-09 10:35",
      "text": "掐指一算",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2vJb8Ncpins-15?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "103551660",
      "date": "26-10-09 10:32",
      "text": "销户来聊天也不错的",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2vJb8Ncpins-15?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "103551656",
      "date": "26-10-09 10:32",
      "text": "销户来聊天也不错的",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2vJb8Ncpins-15?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "103551591",
      "date": "26-10-09 10:31",
      "text": "开始杀恐慌了，大光还差30元！",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2vJb8Ncpins-15?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "103551277",
      "date": "26-10-09 10:27",
      "text": "不知道啊",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2vJb8Ncpins-16?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "103551240",
      "date": "26-10-09 10:26",
      "text": "都成长了吗？",
      "images": [
        "https://image.tgb.cn/img/2026/10/09/32but3496unf.jpg_760w.png"
      ],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2vJb8Ncpins-16?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "103551080",
      "date": "26-10-09 10:25",
      "text": "指数宽基吗？已经超卖了 莫急！",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2vJb8Ncpins-16?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "103551022",
      "date": "26-10-09 10:24",
      "text": "那就好，战士！",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2vJb8Ncpins-17?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "103551011",
      "date": "26-10-09 10:24",
      "text": "你应该怕一说话a股以为你不服",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2vJb8Ncpins-17?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "103550981",
      "date": "26-10-09 10:24",
      "text": "what？陪学今天应该去善水和蛋白粉才对呀，我脑袋瓜一想就能猜到啊",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2vJb8Ncpins-17?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "103550932",
      "date": "26-10-09 10:23",
      "text": "创业板啊",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2vJb8Ncpins-18?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "103550538",
      "date": "26-10-09 10:18",
      "text": "还有人吗\n有人吱一声\n哥们太孤独了",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2vJb8Ncpins-19?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "103550339",
      "date": "26-10-09 10:16",
      "text": "创业板进入到超卖区间",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2vJb8Ncpins-19?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "103549853",
      "date": "26-10-09 10:10",
      "text": "接上文，但蛋白的拉升确实有偏被动，竞价没有表态，这是弱于善水的地方",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2vJb8Ncpins-19?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "103549770",
      "date": "26-10-09 10:09",
      "text": "市场的看点还是以老登为主，也就是非科技。\n因为这里科技后面再拉细分方向太随机\n反过来说，即便指数不止跌，非科相对不会那么暴力\n比如蛋白粉这种抱团，调整两三根k线，再吸引抱团资金形成共识",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2vJb8Ncpins-19?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "103548881",
      "date": "26-10-09 09:58",
      "text": "换言之，想玩伸头一刀，缩头也是一刀，不想玩就安静当乌龟就好",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2vJb8Ncpins-19?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "103548343",
      "date": "26-10-09 09:50",
      "text": "市场和七月科技退潮不一样的点在于，当时七月科技持续杀，只有医药冒头\n现在是非科技的方向多点都在尝试从混沌中穿越出来\n所以想玩的也只能低仓位运行\n目前情绪有试图止跌的意思",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2vJb8Ncpins-19?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "103547881",
      "date": "26-10-09 09:42",
      "text": "科技这边昨天领跌的有出现抵抗迹象，但问题是又出来了新的领跌，难搞！",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2vJb8Ncpins-20?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "103547783",
      "date": "26-10-09 09:40",
      "text": "关注了国轩和先导，控制仓位",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2vJb8Ncpins-20?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "103547323",
      "date": "26-10-09 09:28",
      "text": "【竞价异动】各领风骚都有表态\n锂电，时代，紫竹一字，300\n领湃科技\n高开\n化工，\n善水科技\n红开\n消费，\n拉芳家化\n高开\n地产，万科红开",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2vJb8Ncpins-20?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "103545166",
      "date": "26-10-09 08:12",
      "text": "【10.09圆宝早盘】\n指数层面，节前说过上证大周期还差最后一个衰竭浪，而前提是双创不能往下拽，昨天科创是对创业板完成补跌，那上证这里理论上再跌一下，或者说触碰今年7月的低点，三大指数大概率就会出现协同性。\n而出现协同性的必要条件就是大势止跌，大势止跌就需要昨天表现最弱的\n半导体\n/光芯片止跌，否则科技还是一荣俱荣一损俱损，否则去做科技细分对你们来说太难了！\n所以，假设这里要做多，昨天有表现的题材就都需要看，\n电池\n，药，地产都要看～\n按量化的尿性，电池今天是分歧预期，分歧完不代表结束，毕竟节后第一天电池一度想共振指数，锚定点：\n国轩高科\n，\n先导智能\n。\n药和地产昨天说过了，药昨天被量化集中兑现，今天有回流预期，锚定点近岸既然卡过异动，那今天竞价必须表态。\n地产的核心万科，今天不能掉出5日线，最次要在5日线上止跌，否则周一的节点就卡不到。\n其他的就需要临盘再看！\n综上所述，今日八字箴言是【观察协同，题材表态】，兄弟们可以打在评论区提醒自己，不打嘛，我也没招嘻嘻，祝好！",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2vJb8Ncpins-22?type=new"
    }
  ],
